#: src/prefs.js:29
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "阴影"

#: src/prefs.js:29
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "圆角"

#: src/prefs.js:120 src/prefs.js:128
msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

#: src/prefs.js:148
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: src/prefs.js:154
msgid "Display & Rendering"
msgstr "显示与渲染"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "Control window decoration behavior across screen scales"
msgstr "控制窗口装饰在不同屏幕缩放下的渲染行为"

#: src/prefs.js:160
msgid "Prioritize Crisp Text"
msgstr "优先保证文字清晰"

#: src/prefs.js:161
msgid ""
"Skip rounded corners on fractional scale monitors (retaining shadow) to "
"avoid text blur and resampling overhead"
msgstr ""
"在分数缩放屏幕上免除圆角（保留阴影），消除重采样带来的字体模糊与性能损耗"

#: src/prefs.js:173
msgid "Suppress Rules"
msgstr "屏蔽规则"

#: src/prefs.js:174
msgid ""
"Windows CSD Fixer leaves alone. A switch turned on means that decoration is "
"not drawn."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 不处理的窗口。打开某个开关表示不绘制该装饰。"

#: src/prefs.js:175
msgid "Suppress Window…"
msgstr "屏蔽窗口…"

#: src/prefs.js:177
msgid "Click an on-screen window to stop decorating it"
msgstr "点击屏幕上的窗口，停止为它补装饰"

#: src/prefs.js:178
msgid "No Suppress Rules"
msgstr "暂无屏蔽规则"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Force Rules"
msgstr "强制规则"

#: src/prefs.js:183
msgid ""
"Windows CSD Fixer decorates even when detection assumes Mutter or the "
"application already drew something. A switch turned on means that decoration "
"is forced on."
msgstr "即使自动判定认为 Mutter 或应用已经画过，CSD Fixer 仍会为该窗口绘制装饰。打开某个开关表示强制绘制该装饰。"

#: src/prefs.js:184
msgid "Force Window…"
msgstr "强制窗口…"

#: src/prefs.js:186
msgid "Click an on-screen window to decorate it despite detection"
msgstr "点击屏幕上的窗口，无视自动判定强制补装饰"

#: src/prefs.js:187
msgid "No Force Rules"
msgstr "暂无强制规则"

#: src/prefs.js:264
msgid "Remove Rule"
msgstr "删除规则"

#: src/prefs.js:316
msgid "Window Inspection Failed"
msgstr "窗口拾取失败"

#: src/prefs.js:317
msgid ""
"Could not connect to CSD Fixer extension. Please ensure the extension is "
"enabled."
msgstr "无法连接到 CSD Fixer 扩展，请确认该扩展已在 GNOME 扩展中启用。"

#: src/prefs.js:333
msgid "Window Not Recognized"
msgstr "无法识别窗口"

#: src/prefs.js:334
msgid "CSD Fixer could not identify this window, so no rule was created."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 无法识别这个窗口，因此没有创建规则。"

#: src/prefs.js:347
msgid "Rule Not Saved"
msgstr "规则未保存"

#: src/prefs.js:348
msgid "CSD Fixer could not store a rule for this window."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 无法为这个窗口保存规则。"

#: src/prefs.js:354
#, javascript-format
msgid "Added rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "已为“%s”添加排除规则"
